{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMPETE</strong> against friends or on the leaderboards</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seasonal Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or Long-term friend rivalries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EARN</strong> seasonal rewards for your leaderboard placements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Badges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn rare achievements by acquiring the top Medals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLOCK</strong> progress through a range of ships</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the best ship for each race</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flex your levels on your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new maps by leveling up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Coming Soon:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Canyons -</strong> Feel the sharpness of the turns as you simultaneously dodge jutting rock formations while staying low to the ground</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asteroid Clusters</strong> - Race through this intense Zero-G environment, where one wrong move while send you flying out into space</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beach</strong>\u00a0- Feel the laid back, beginner friendly maps of the beach, with satisfying straightaways and open paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weather</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the existing maps with a new challenge, weather. Feel the winds slowing speeds and limiting rotations. With limited visibility, take on the challenge for even more clout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More ships are in the pipeline for a more diverse experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Checkpoint effects are in the pipeline to alter how your ship flies for less competitive map options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engine Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VTOL Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inverse Controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bricked Controls</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730930?t=1747696133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730930?t=1747696133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730930/0e523e50fdb01b5194af4b0ffed0721e3e408334/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747696133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730930/0e523e50fdb01b5194af4b0ffed0721e3e408334/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747696133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COMPETE</strong> against friends or on the leaderboards</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seasonal Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or Long-term friend rivalries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EARN</strong> seasonal rewards for your leaderboard placements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Badges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn rare achievements by acquiring the top Medals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNLOCK</strong> progress through a range of ships</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the best ship for each race</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flex your levels on your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new maps by leveling up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Coming Soon:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Canyons -</strong> Feel the sharpness of the turns as you simultaneously dodge jutting rock formations while staying low to the ground</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asteroid Clusters</strong> - Race through this intense Zero-G environment, where one wrong move while send you flying out into space</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beach</strong>\u00a0- Feel the laid back, beginner friendly maps of the beach, with satisfying straightaways and open paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weather</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the existing maps with a new challenge, weather. Feel the winds slowing speeds and limiting rotations. With limited visibility, take on the challenge for even more clout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More ships are in the pipeline for a more diverse experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Checkpoint effects are in the pipeline to alter how your ship flies for less competitive map options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engine Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VTOL Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inverse Controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bricked Controls</p></li></ul>","developers":["Covenant Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730930/3d7143cf3f056da9742a87b90bf952a8ac858b90/header.jpg?t=1747696133","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Star Tracer","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500k, AMD 2nd Gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 or AMD RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor